model r6_reach
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.1.7, R6's reach (#145): next(K, d) where two movements share the first day: its definition, first(m in K over d ..) ties by m.day, is refused RUN-TIE, and so is next, its message naming the form as written (n_tie_next, n_tie_first)"

source card "T's card (invented)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input fee: money PLN

input late: date

input d0: date

input d1: date

input d9: date

move gift2: transfers
  on late
  leg cash from world to konto amount fee

move gift: transfers
  on late
  leg cash from world to konto amount fee

ask n_tie_next: next(transfers, d1)

ask n_tie_first: first(t in transfers over d1 ..) ties by t.day





version v_card
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  fee = ?"how much is the gift?"
  late = 2026-06-10 "after the cut"
  d0 = 2026-02-01 "the card"
  d1 = 2026-03-02 "after the cut"
  d9 = 2026-02-28 "the card"
  opening[konto] = 100.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "the card"
